  = note: `<foreach>` assigns each array element (`item`) and its position (`index`) to a variable with this name, creating it when it is not declared; the name must be a legal identifier of the `ecmascript` data model
  = help: use a name that starts with a letter or `$` and contains only ASCII letters, digits, `_`, and `$` (the ECMAScript data model reserves names that start with `_` for system variables)
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §4.6 <foreach>
